15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Ghosn plans to take possession of the ball from Razor, but how?

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I didn't think I'd need to use this.

17
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,000
I haven't felt this good in a long time.

18
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Wait, straight up?

19
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Then does that mean...

20
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,000
He's gonna spike it?

21
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Hey, over there!

22
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Wait, they're going to...

23
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Merge!

24
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
I see what you're trying to do!

25
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,000
This battle determines...

26
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The winner!

27
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
That's their strategy.

28
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Ghosn stops it.

29
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Hisoka traps it.

30
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,000
And Killua braces it!

31
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:18,000
They did it!

32
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:22,000
They did it!

33
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:32,000
They stopped the ball!

34
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Way to go!

35
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
I gotta give them credit.

36
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Their skills prevailed over my power.

37
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:48,000
And it seems to me that the key to their success was that boy, Killua.

38
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Ghosn focused all of his aura in his hands to catch the ball.

39
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:01,000
The concentration and focus that it took to pull that off are commendable.

40
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:08,000
The moment it reached Ghosn's hands, Hisoka enveloped the ball with his ability so Ghosn wouldn't drop it.

41
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Had his technique been anything short of perfect, it's safe to say that the ball would have bounced off.

42
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,000
And Killua.

43
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:25,000
He was stuck between them, acting as both cushion and brace, balancing his aura between offense and defense.

44
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:36,000
If the aura around his body had been too weak, he would have failed to work as a cushion, and all three of them would have taken major damage from the ball's impact.

45
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:47,000
On the other hand, if he hadn't used enough aura on his legs, he would have failed to act as a brace, and the ball would have knocked all three of them outside of the court.

46
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:56,000
That required precise distribution of aura between his body and legs, leaving a margin of error of less than 1%.

47
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,000
That's a feat which demands both experience and skill.

48
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:08,000
But Killua overcame his inexperience with his prodigious insight, allowing him to perform such a difficult task.

49
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:15,000
What incredible talent! I didn't reach that point myself until I was in my late twenties.

50
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:22,000
I have to win before they merge. After they attack, I'll have my opening.

51
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:27,000
If I time it right, they won't be able to move into position.

52
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Gon's throw is powerful. That much is painfully obvious.

53
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:38,000
But now, I have the power to catch it without having to worry about being bounced back.

54
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:45,000
And then, I can pick them off one by one.

55
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:49,000
I need more power.

56
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
More.

57
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,000
More!

58
