70
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Is he?

71
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,000
But how?

72
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,000
How?

73
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:19,000
He's a monster.

74
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
You should be proud, Jin.

75
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:26,000
This kid's your son. There's no doubt about it.

76
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Hey, Killua. I'm gonna give it everything I've got.

77
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:36,000
You better. Or you'll hear about it from me.

78
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Now, show me Rock!

79
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
John!

80
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
Ken!

81
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Rock!

82
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Rock!

83
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,000
Ha!

84
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Stronger than I thought, but I can catch it.

85
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:08,000
However, at that speed, the Force will definitely push me out of bounds.

86
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:13,000
So catching it's not an option, but I can't shy away either.

87
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Come on!

88
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,000
He's bumping it again?

89
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Hisoka's just gonna grab it, moron!

90
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
You sure about that?

91
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,000
That depends...

92
