94
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:39,000
Go! Try to dodge it! You'll still win!

95
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,000
No way! He'll never dodge!

96
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Because that isn't how he wants to defeat me!

97
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
I've learned that much about him in this match!

98
