100
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:01,000
He used up every last ounce of his strength with all that aura he expended.

101
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:06,000
You can take pride in this. You've won, Gon.

102
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Not quite yet.

103
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
